# The build compiles the whole module from the context (Dockerfile `COPY ./ ./`),
# so exclude only build artifacts + what the compile never reads. `-buildvcs=false`
# makes `.git/` unused. The `.*` rule below also keeps `.env*` secrets out of the
# daemon and the layers.
# Build, test and tooling artifacts, and local runtime state.
bin/
data/
*.db
coverage.out
coverage.html
conformance-tests/
# Root-level dot-files and dot-directories (VCS, env files, tool, editor and cache state, CI config); the build reads none.
.*
# Editor junk.
*.iml
*.swp
# Non-compiled trees the hub binary build never reads.
gatling/
charts/
